    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "0d240b0f-a6ee-4cb9-8e5c-1c4ff0332312",
        "data": {
          "title": "Non-Player Character",
          "accent": "#ecdfc4",
          "anchor": "lower-left",
          "eyebrow": "DON'T CREATE YOUR CHARACTER",
          "subtitle": "I asked you not to select this type, but you did anyway.\nMy, aren't you a little Rebel?",
          "vignette": 100,
          "background": {
            "url": "https://media.craftrpgs.com/containers/019fde04-44fd-75c8-8f5e-d680c880596d/images/292d90e8-513f-4d2f-b3b0-e74b55e809cf",
            "kind": "image"
          }
        },
        "type": "cover"
      },
      {
        "id": "node_cc9ebc10-42c3-4b54-839c-724c3e74052a",
        "data": {
          "accent": "#ecdfc4",
          "anchor": "lower-left",
          "layout": "list",
          "prompt": "Which part of \"Non-Player Character\" don't you understand?",
          "eyebrow": "",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "info": "It sounds French.",
              "label": "The \"Non\" part"
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "info": "Player means I can play it, right?",
              "label": "The \"Player\" part"
            },
            {
              "id": "the_character_part",
              "info": "It's a character, I want a character, what's the problem?",
              "label": "The \"Character\" part",
              "ai_instruction": ""
            }
          ],
          "multiple": false,
          "vignette": 100,
          "background": {
            "url": "https://media.craftrpgs.com/containers/019fde04-44fd-75c8-8f5e-d680c880596d/images/77403ee5-9705-4a11-bacb-93e84a904434",
            "kind": "image"
          },
          "ai_instruction": ""
        },
        "type": "choice",
        "field": "your_question"
      },
      {
        "id": "node_5966ecb9-c7bc-487c-8318-8d07202b2158",
        "data": {
          "body": "non- (prefix)\n\nUsed in the sense of \"no\" or \"none\", to show lack of or failure to perform; or in the sense of \"not\", to negate the meaning of the word to which it is prefixed.\n\nExamples:\n- nonpayment (“lack of payment, failure to pay”)\n- nonaggressive (“not aggressive”)\n\nIn the case of  \"Non-Player Character\", we have the second meaning: It is NOT a player character; which means it can't be played.",
          "title": "The meaning of \"Non-\"",
          "accent": "#ecdfc4",
          "anchor": "lower-left",
          "eyebrow": "You don't understand the \"Non\" part",
          "vignette": 100,
          "background": {
            "url": "https://media.craftrpgs.com/containers/019fde04-44fd-75c8-8f5e-d680c880596d/images/93b36678-cfbf-458f-b3dd-3000abae1abf",
            "kind": "image"
          }
        },
        "type": "statement"
      },
      {
        "id": "node_b28c41b0-f84a-432b-ab5a-c95fa8b3a515",
        "data": {
          "accent": "#ecdfc4",
          "anchor": "lower-left",
          "layout": "list",
          "prompt": "So please go back to the character selection screen.",
          "eyebrow": "",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "label": "Alright"
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "label": "I still don't understand..."
            }
          ],
          "multiple": false,
          "vignette": 100,
          "background": {
            "url": "https://media.craftrpgs.com/containers/019fde04-44fd-75c8-8f5e-d680c880596d/images/9e428b0c-c4a2-4e5d-adae-8e76da0c61f0",
            "kind": "image"
          },
          "ai_instruction": ""
        },
        "type": "choice",
        "field": "your_question_2"
      },
      {
        "id": "node_6d7ddfc7-73a5-42a4-9eb3-068b8979db85",
        "data": {
          "accent": "#ecdfc4",
          "anchor": "lower-left",
          "layout": "list",
          "prompt": "Now.",
          "eyebrow": "Why are you still here?",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "label": "Ok"
            },
            {
              "id": "how",
              "label": "How do I go back?",
              "ai_instruction": ""
            }
          ],
          "multiple": false,
          "vignette": 100,
          "background": {
            "url": "https://media.craftrpgs.com/containers/019fde04-44fd-75c8-8f5e-d680c880596d/images/e3166b60-ee65-46bd-a502-f1dce1edf1b2",
            "kind": "image"
          },
          "ai_instruction": ""
        },
        "type": "choice",
        "field": "your_question_3"
      },
      {
        "id": "node_e0460ee2-dfc3-4509-beb9-8229b190cad5",
        "data": {
          "body": "Yes, \"player\" alone means that you can play the character. But there's a \"Non-\" before that, which negates that: This kind of character is NOT playable.",
          "title": "The meaning of \"Player\"",
          "accent": "#ecdfc4",
          "anchor": "lower-left",
          "eyebrow": "You don't understand the \"Player\" part",
          "vignette": 100,
          "background": {
            "url": "https://media.craftrpgs.com/containers/019fde04-44fd-75c8-8f5e-d680c880596d/images/e45b900d-349c-43b7-9704-394674e0569c",
            "kind": "image"
          }
        },
        "type": "statement"
      },
      {
        "id": "node_230221c5-aad5-4804-8869-36d2672b422c",
        "data": {
          "body": "A game contains many kinds of characters. Some are playable (\"\"Player Character\" or \"PC\"), and some are not playable (\"Non-Player Character\" or \"NPC\") .\nCraft doesn't understand that; it proposes all kinds of characters as playable. But you are a human; you should understand the difference.",
          "title": "The meaning of \"Character\"",
          "accent": "#ecdfc4",
          "anchor": "lower-left",
          "eyebrow": "You don't understand the \"Character\" part",
          "vignette": 100,
          "background": {
            "url": "https://media.craftrpgs.com/containers/019fde04-44fd-75c8-8f5e-d680c880596d/images/1b188133-91aa-4191-afb5-a836dbda9e31",
            "kind": "image"
          }
        },
        "type": "statement"
      },
      {
        "id": "node_defb033f-caa1-4554-ab9d-30d25d2c8ad8",
        "data": {
          "body": "Look at the top left corner of your screen, left of the progress bar. There's a little arrow. See it? Click onto that arrow until it becomes an \"x\", then click once more.\n\nYou're welcome.",
          "title": "How to go back?",
          "accent": "#ecdfc4",
          "anchor": "lower-left",
          "eyebrow": "",
          "vignette": 100,
          "background": {
            "url": "https://media.craftrpgs.com/containers/019fde04-44fd-75c8-8f5e-d680c880596d/images/292d90e8-513f-4d2f-b3b0-e74b55e809cf",
            "kind": "image"
          }
        },
        "type": "statement"
      }
    ],
    "start": "0d240b0f-a6ee-4cb9-8e5c-1c4ff0332312",
